#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option allows you to select where the user/group data stored. Currently "
"three storage backends are supported. <BR><B>Files</B> "
"stores user/group data in traditional /etc/passwd and /etc/group flat files. "
"<BR><B>LDAP</B> stores data in a directory server using the posixAccount and "
"posixGroup object classes; this backend allows the management of Samba "
"users/groups via the sambaSamAccount object class.<BR><B>System</B> "
"provides a read-only access to all users and groups which your installation "
"knows about."
msgstr ""
"此選項讓你選擇在哪裡儲存用戶/群組資料。目前支援三種儲存後端。<BR><B>檔案</B>將用戶/群組資料儲存在傳統的 /etc/passwd 及 "
"/etc/group 檔案。<BR><B>LDAP</B>將資料儲存在目錄伺服器的 posixAccount 及 posixGroup "
"物件類別中；此後端容許從 sambaSamAccount 物件類別管理 Samba 的用戶/群組。<BR><B>系統</B>"
"提供你的套件安裝認識的所有用戶和群組的唯讀存取。"

